# Scramp

A Python implementation of the [SCRAM authentication protocol](
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salted_Challenge_Response_Authentication_Mechanism).
Scramp supports the following mechanisms:

- SCRAM-SHA-1
- SCRAM-SHA-1-PLUS
- SCRAM-SHA-256
- SCRAM-SHA-256-PLUS
- SCRAM-SHA-512
- SCRAM-SHA-512-PLUS
- SCRAM-SHA3-512
- SCRAM-SHA3-512-PLUS

